{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot approaches and takes object. Then it checks properties and does specific task, finally releasing object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInGrasp    />",
